    "relative-predicate-stored-absolute",
    "int64-max-saturation"
  ],
  "why": "stellar-core converts a relative predicate to an absolute time when it stores the balance, saturating at INT64_MAX. A reader that shows the operation's predicate as the balance's, or adds the close time itself and overflows, reports a condition the ledger does not hold.",
